OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Square plans tweaked after
OL,4,Atraders' worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FA multi-million pound plan to
OL,7,Fregenerate a city's historic market has
OL,8,Fbeen tweaked after concerns were raised
OL,9,Fby traders.
OL,11,FCambridge's Market Square has had
OL,12,Ftraders since the Middle Ages and the
OL,13,Frevamp is part of a #92m city centre
OL,14,Fredevelopment.
OL,16,FAn application was deferred by
OL,17,FCambridge City Council's planning
OL,18,Fcommittee in March after stallholders
OL,19,Fsaid the plans could put them under
OL,20,Ffinancial pressure.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
